WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:02.936
-Guys, today's the day
that is all about giving thanks,

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.437
so I thought,
what better day to write up

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:05.471
my weekly thank you notes?

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:06.839
Do you guys mind?
Is that okay?

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:08.908
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.810
James, can I get some
thank you note-writing

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:11.810
music, please?

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.147
[ Gentle melody playing ]

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:21.721 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.791
-Thank you,
Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade,

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:27.560
for being the worst time
for the edibles to kick in.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.796
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:32.632 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:36.769
-[ Slow-mo ] Spongebob.

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.405 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.506
-Thank you,
Thanksgiving leftovers,

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:44.344
for also being a sly way
to steal someone's Tupperware.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.578
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:46.846
"I'll return it."

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:48.248
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:52.252 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:54.620
-Thank you,
electric carving knife,

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.789
for making it sound like
my turkey has

00:00:56.789 --> 00:00:58.124
a personal massager.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.892
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.892 --> 00:01:01.193
[ Buzzing sound ]

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:02.862
-Ew. Ew. Wow.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.897
I just got that one.

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:06.666
-I'm not sure if I did.

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.834
-Oh, my God.

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:11.904
-Thank you, playing
a board game with family

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:14.307
after Thanksgiving dinner,
for being a fun way to say,

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.242
"I don't think
we've fought enough yet."

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.445
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.985
Thank you,
inflatable yard decorations,

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:28.054
for letting my neighbors
celebrate the holidays

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:29.555
with a 24/7 leaf blower.

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:31.591
There you have it, everybody.
Those are my thank you notes!

